        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_18",
      "hash64": "443199A64238152C",
      "text": "E poi un’altra cosa! Devi sapere che il mio\\nGrowlithe ha un fratellino che ama le lotte.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_19",
      "hash64": "44319AA6423816DF",
      "text": "Ho come l’impressione che sia meglio se lo\\nalleni tu, così potrà diventare bello forte.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_system_01",
      "hash64": "FB7A90977AC48E50",
      "text": "Hai ricevuto un Growlithe da Litha!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_20",
      "hash64": "443B93A642405F7F",
      "text": "Allenalo e fallo diventare fortissimo![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_21",
      "hash64": "443B92A642405DCC",
      "text": "Bene, con questo posso considerare conclusa\\nla mia visita a Nordivia.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_22",
      "hash64": "443B95A6424062E5",
      "text": "Devo dire che mi dispiace, ma è giunto\\nil momento di salutarci.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_23",
      "hash64": "443B94A642406132",
      "text": "I Growlithe di Hisui fanno sempre coppia\\ncon un altro esemplare della loro specie.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_24",
      "hash64": "443B8FA6424058B3",
      "text": "Anche se per un po’ rimarranno separati,\\nil destino li farà senz’altro rincontrare.\\r\\nBasta solo che ci prendiamo cura di loro![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_select_05",
      "hash64": "7574A056FDB0F677",
      "text": "Si rincontreranno di sicuro!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
